{
  "schema": "lusiform.inventory/1",
  "template": "startup",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "notes": [
    "One entry per Terraform resource block in modules/. The Terraform address is module.<module>.<address>.",
    "representation: 'node' is drawn as a diagram node, 'group' as a container, 'hidden' is listed in graph.hidden.",
    "instances: {fixed: n}, {parameter: '<module>.<name>'} for a count set by a template parameter, or {optional: '<root variable>'} for 0 or 1 set by a deploy-time input that is not a template parameter.",
    "pricing: hints for the estimate service; the Pricing API filters and quantity formulas live in the estimate service's pricing map.",
    "Data sources (aws_caller_identity, aws_partition, aws_region) create nothing and are not listed."
  ],
  "resources": [
    {"module": "network", "address": "aws_vpc.this", "type": "aws_vpc", "representation": "group", "group": "vpc", "instances": {"fixed": 1}, "pricing": []},
